  "description": {
   "en": "An unfinished masterpiece by Shoji Hiroyuki that questions the very nature of family! When the second daughter of the Nanakusa family is assaulted, an emergency meeting is held. Should they go to the police? The hospital? Maybe they should just give up? The answer they come to is… revenge!? With eccentric parents, five daughters, and one son, this large family’s “adventure” begins!"
